      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-08-30T17:04:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, yes, you knew what I meant :-P &nbsp;<span>I thought about correcting myself, but felt that it wasn't worth it. &nbsp;Besides, the July issue wasn't a full issue, just a half-size issue #0 prelude (that's my story and I'm sticking to it).</span></p><p>What'd you think of the full-on #1 for the new series? &nbsp;I _loved_ it and am really excited to see where the story goes and how we got from Defined to Denied.</p><p>Plus, Matt's art is just amazing and his son's work on the coloring is excellent.</p>",
