      "raw": "<p>Yes, yes, you knew what I meant :-P &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">I thought about correcting myself, but felt that it wasn&#39;t worth it. &nbsp;Besides, the July issue wasn&#39;t a full issue, just a half-size issue #0 prelude (that&#39;s my story and I&#39;m sticking to it).</span></p><p>What&#39;d you think of the full-on #1 for the new series? &nbsp;I _loved_ it and am really excited to see where the story goes and how we got from Defined to Denied.</p><p>Plus, Matt&#39;s art is just amazing and his son&#39;s work on the coloring is excellent.</p>",
