      "id": 201891,
      "name": "Matchstickman",
      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-08-30T17:58:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I forgot that was his son doing the colouring.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm loving (whole one issue!) series so far, though I do think it was odd the way they framed the \"reveal\" of his wife, we knew who it was going to be from the get go so I'm not sure what the point of concealing her face was.</p><p>And finally(!) we will get to know more about the pack by the end of the series, I figure it's death or time. And who will be Mage this time around? I suspect we will see a similar transformation into Mirth again.</p>",
