      "raw": "<p>I forgot that was his son doing the colouring.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I&#39;m loving (whole one issue!) series so far, though I do think it was odd the way they framed the &quot;reveal&quot; of his wife, we knew who it was going to be from the get go so I&#39;m not sure what the point of concealing her face was.</p><p>And finally(!) we will get to know more about the pack by the end of the series, I figure it&#39;s death or time. And who will be Mage this time around? I suspect we will see a similar transformation into Mirth again.</p>",
